Source: rndis-host
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: root <root@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: rndis-host
Architecture: all
Description: stable usb0 name for USB RNDIS uplink adapters
 Ships a systemd .link file that matches Driver=rndis_host and pins
 the interface name to usb0, so host-side configs (bridges, nft, dhcp)
 survive adapter re-enumeration with randomized MAC addresses.
